###

### [Negative][Catalog] Unauthenticated PUT /api/labor-types/{id} (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types/{{GhostId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "UNAUTH-LT", "name": "Unauthenticated", "hourlyNetRate": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27, "version": 1 }

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Catalog] Unauthenticated DELETE /api/labor-types/{id} (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types/{{GhostId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

